  "notes": [
    "Hardware clients use VA decoders with VAMemory; the RTSP server itself never decodes or encodes.",
    "Encoded-only clients verify the Qt/GPU-free standalone executable.",
    "MP4 fixture includes AAC audio, which is discarded. UTF8 BOM, CRLF, blank/comment lines and paths with spaces are exercised.",
    "A 12-second run with six hardware clients crossed multiple two-second file loops; one URL shared two clients and another client disconnected/reconnected.",
    "Variable frame intervals of 1/30 and 2/30 seconds remained distinct. Loop spans cover DTS as well as PTS; source edit/reorder padding may hold the last image briefly.",
    "The isomp4 plugin was enabled and built locally; only the new plugin was installed, without overwriting libraries used by existing applications."
  ],
